        <li><a href="/app/punch-in" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">绅士签到</a> - 每日签到</li>
        <li><a href="/app/game" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">绅士冒险</a> - 游戏冒险</li>
        <li><a href="/app/bounty" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">绅士求物板</a> - 发布和浏览求物</li>
